{"seq":1,"slug":"pointer-based-dnd","title":"基于指针事件的拖放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/mechanics/pointer-based-dnd","wordCount":1326,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"基于指针事件的拖放\">基于指针事件的拖放</h1><p>现在动手造内核。目标是不碰 <code>draggable</code>、不碰任何拖放事件，只用指针事件（Pointer Events）从零实现一次跟手的拖拽——按下、移动、抬起，翻译成拖拽物贴着指针飞。这套机制是本 hub 后续所有行为的地基，且完全框架无关：同一份逻辑在 React、Vue、原生 JS 里骨架一致。指针与手势的通用基础在<a href=\"../../frontend-microinteractions/input-gestures/pointer-events\">《指针事件》</a>，本篇专注它在拖放里的具体用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-手写拖放内核的四个关键点\">核心概念：手写拖放内核的四个关键点</h2><p>从零实现一次跟手拖拽，绕不开四个关键点，本篇逐一击破：<strong>选对输入</strong>（指针事件统一鼠标/触摸/触控笔，配 <code>touch-action</code> 消解滚动冲突）、<strong>指针捕获</strong>（<code>setPointerCapture</code> 防止快速移动时拖拽掉线，<code>pointercancel</code> 必须与 <code>pointerup</code> 同路清理）、<strong>激活约束</strong>（距离/延迟阈值区分点击与拖拽）、以及<strong>跟手渲染</strong>（只改 <code>transform</code>、用 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 对齐刷新率）。这四点做对，一个框架无关的拖放内核就成型了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是指针事件-而不是鼠标或触摸\">为什么是指针事件，而不是鼠标或触摸</h2><p>指针事件把鼠标、触摸、触控笔统一成一套 API。一次 <code>pointerdown</code> 无论来自哪种设备，字段都一致，还带 <code>pointerId</code>、<code>pressure</code>、<code>pointerType</code> 等元信息。这一条就解决了原生拖放&quot;移动端不触发&quot;的根本病根——手指按下同样派发 <code>pointerdown</code>。下表对比三种可选输入模型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>覆盖设备</th>\n<th>需要几套代码</th>\n<th>拖放适用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MouseEvent</td>\n<td>仅鼠标/触控板</td>\n<td>1，但漏触摸</td>\n<td>差，移动端失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TouchEvent</td>\n<td>仅触摸</td>\n<td>需与 mouse 并存，共 2 套</td>\n<td>中，桌面要另写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PointerEvent</td>\n<td>鼠标+触摸+触控笔</td>\n<td>1 套</td>\n<td>好，统一入口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结论清晰：用一套指针事件即可覆盖全部输入。唯一要额外操心的是触摸场景下拖拽与页面滚动的冲突，这靠 CSS 的 <code>touch-action</code> 声明——给可拖动元素设 <code>touch-action: none</code>，告诉浏览器&quot;这里的手势归我，别拿去滚动&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指针捕获-别让拖拽在快速移动时掉线\">指针捕获：别让拖拽在快速移动时掉线</h2><p>手写拖拽最先踩的坑是：鼠标一快，指针跑出了被拖元素的范围，<code>pointermove</code> 就不再派发到它身上，拖拽当场断掉。解决办法是<strong>指针捕获</strong>——在 <code>pointerdown</code> 里调用 <code>el.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)</code>，此后无论指针飘到页面哪个角落，所有 <code>pointermove</code>/<code>pointerup</code> 都被强制送回这个元素。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[pointerdown] --&gt; B[setPointerCapture pointerId]&#10;  B --&gt; C[记录 initial 坐标, status=pending]&#10;  C --&gt; D[pointermove]&#10;  D --&gt; E{位移超激活阈值?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| D&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[status=dragging, 开始跟手]&#10;  F --&gt; G[pointermove: 更新 delta, transform]&#10;  G --&gt; H[pointerup / pointercancel]&#10;  H --&gt; I[releasePointerCapture, 提交或回滚]\">flowchart TD\n  A[pointerdown] --&gt; B[setPointerCapture pointerId]\n  B --&gt; C[记录 initial 坐标, status=pending]\n  C --&gt; D[pointermove]\n  D --&gt; E{位移超激活阈值?}\n  E --&gt;|否| D\n  E --&gt;|是| F[status=dragging, 开始跟手]\n  F --&gt; G[pointermove: 更新 delta, transform]\n  G --&gt; H[pointerup / pointercancel]\n  H --&gt; I[releasePointerCapture, 提交或回滚]</pre><p>配对的是 <code>pointercancel</code>：系统在某些情况下（来电、手势被系统接管、Android 上的滚动接管）会强行中止指针，此时<strong>收不到 <code>pointerup</code></strong>。忘了处理 <code>pointercancel</code>，拖拽就会卡在&quot;永远 dragging&quot;的状态。dnd-kit 在 2026 年 2 月还专门修过一个 Android 上因未处理 <code>pointercancel</code> 导致的崩溃（来源：dnd-kit changelog，2026-02），可见这条边界之重要。务必把 <code>pointercancel</code> 和 <code>pointerup</code> 走同一套清理逻辑（只是一个提交、一个回滚）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"激活约束-区分点击与拖拽\">激活约束：区分点击与拖拽</h2><p>如果 <code>pointerdown</code> 一按下就进入拖拽，用户想点击列表项打开详情时会误触发拖动。所以需要<strong>激活约束</strong>：按下后先进 <code>pending</code> 态，只有满足条件才升级为 <code>dragging</code>。两种常见约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>距离约束</strong>：指针移动超过阈值（常见 5–8px）才激活，适合鼠标——点击几乎不位移，拖拽必然位移。判定用欧氏距离：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>threshold</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\sqrt{(x - x_0)^2 + (y - y_0)^2} &gt; d_{\\text{threshold}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.2561em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9839em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9439em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2561em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">threshold</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>延迟约束</strong>：按住超过一段时间（如 250ms）且期间位移不大才激活，适合触摸——手指要先&quot;长按&quot;确认拖拽意图，避免与滚动手势冲突。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>dnd-kit 的 PointerSensor 就把这两者做成 <code>activationConstraint</code>，还在 2026 年新增了 <code>preventActivation</code> 选项，用于在按钮、输入框等可交互子元素上有条件地阻止激活（来源：dnd-kit changelog，2026）。手指长按与滚动的消歧细节，可参考<a href=\"../../frontend-microinteractions/input-gestures/touch-gestures\">《触摸手势》</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跟手渲染-只动-transform-节流到帧\">跟手渲染：只动 transform，节流到帧</h2><p>激活后，每次 <code>pointermove</code> 都要更新拖拽物位置。铁律是<strong>只改 <code>transform</code>，绝不改 <code>left</code>/<code>top</code></strong>——前者可在合成线程完成、不触发布局与重排，后者每帧都逼浏览器重新排版。位置公式就是模型章说过的&quot;初始 + 位移&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// pointermove 里&#10;const dx = e.clientX - initial.x;&#10;const dy = e.clientY - initial.y;&#10;node.style.transform = `translate3d(${dx}px, ${dy}px, 0)`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// pointermove 里</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const dx = e.clientX - initial.x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const dy = e.clientY - initial.y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>node.style.transform = `translate3d(${dx}px, ${dy}px, 0)`;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>pointermove</code> 在高频设备上一秒能派发上百次，远超屏幕刷新率，逐次改样式是浪费。正确做法是把最新坐标存进变量，用 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 每帧只写一次 DOM，把渲染频率对齐到刷新率。命中检测同样挂在这个 rAF 循环里跑，避免在 <code>pointermove</code> 里同步读 <code>getBoundingClientRect</code> 造成强制同步布局。合成层与主线程的性能原理，见<a href=\"../../web-animation/performance/pipeline-and-compositor\">《渲染管线与合成器》</a>；命中检测的算法见下一篇<a href=\"hit-detection\">《命中检测与碰撞》</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>指针事件用一套 API 覆盖鼠标/触摸/触控笔，是解决&quot;移动端拖放不触发&quot;的根本手段；配 <code>touch-action: none</code> 化解与滚动的冲突。</li>\n<li><code>setPointerCapture</code> 防止快速移动时拖拽掉线；必须把 <code>pointercancel</code> 与 <code>pointerup</code> 走同一清理路径，否则拖拽会卡死。</li>\n<li>激活约束（距离/延迟）把点击与拖拽区分开，避免误触发；可交互子元素上用 <code>preventActivation</code> 排除。</li>\n<li>跟手渲染只改 <code>transform</code>，坐标缓存进变量、用 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 每帧写一次，命中检测同挂 rAF 循环。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"../foundations/dnd-model\">《拖放数据模型》</a> —— 传感器角色的抽象定义。</li>\n<li>下一篇：<a href=\"hit-detection\">《命中检测与碰撞》</a> —— 拖拽物压在谁身上怎么算。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../frontend-microinteractions/input-gestures/pointer-events\">《指针事件》</a> —— 指针事件与手势的通用基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基于指针事件的拖放","id":"基于指针事件的拖放"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：手写拖放内核的四个关键点","id":"核心概念-手写拖放内核的四个关键点"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么是指针事件，而不是鼠标或触摸","id":"为什么是指针事件-而不是鼠标或触摸"},{"level":2,"text":"指针捕获：别让拖拽在快速移动时掉线","id":"指针捕获-别让拖拽在快速移动时掉线"},{"level":2,"text":"激活约束：区分点击与拖拽","id":"激活约束-区分点击与拖拽"},{"level":2,"text":"跟手渲染：只动 transform，节流到帧","id":"跟手渲染-只动-transform-节流到帧"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"拖放数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/foundations/dnd-model"},"next":{"title":"命中检测与碰撞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-drag-drop-interactions/mechanics/hit-detection"}}